Siwis (fr_FR-siwis-medium), a Piper voice

Trained on the SIWIS French Speech Synthesis Database (Honnet, Lazaridis, Garner and Yamagishi, University of
Edinburgh, https://datashare.ed.ac.uk/handle/10283/2353), licensed under CC BY 4.0:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/. Fine-tuned from Piper's hifi_tts_92 base model: the voice of Cori
Samuel, a volunteer reader for LibriVox (https://librivox.org), trained on her recordings in the Hi-Fi
Multi-Speaker English TTS Dataset by NVIDIA Corporation (Bakhturina, Lavrukhin, Ginsburg and Zhang, "Hi-Fi
Multi-Speaker English TTS Dataset", Interspeech 2021, https://www.openslr.org/109/), which is licensed under CC BY
4.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/. The voice is a model trained from those recordings, not the
recordings themselves. The model is under the MIT licence beside this file.
